{
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.detail": "厚厚的蛛网覆满石室。苍白的绿色卵囊簇拥在潮湿的地面 上。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.detail-3": "你是在帮我们吗？",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.detail-4": "首次踩上（13, -19）的感应板，开始「遭遇蜘蛛奥布拉」事件。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue": "选择「试着和蜘蛛说话。」（依剧情进度）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-10": "只要卵群不受侵犯，她就不会对你动手。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-11": "选择「试着和蜘蛛说话。」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-12": "你开口，但蜘蛛没有理解的样子。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-13": "她只用一声低嘶回应。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-14": "她大多数眼睛飘回卵上。其余的仍固定在你身上。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-15": "选择「仔细检查蜘蛛。」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-16": "她腹部下方一道干净的伤口引起你的注意。不是野兽造成的。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-17": "有人刻意取走了她的毒刺。干净。几乎像外科手术。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-18": "选择「通过灵魂延伸感知。」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-19": "你感觉不到她自己的恐惧……只担心蛋里等待的生命。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-2": "厚厚的蛛网覆满石室。苍白的绿色卵囊簇拥在潮湿的地面上。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-20": "然后是无法忍受的痛苦。有什么重要的东西从她体内被撕走，只留下空洞的伤口。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-21": "蜘蛛动了动。她的腿收紧，环住最近的卵。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-22": "那些声音不过是咔哒和嘶声，却不知为何承载着意义。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-23": "「两腿……冷味……小偷……骗子……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-24": "「拿走刺……拿走毒……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-25": "「饥饿……恐惧……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-26": "是谁干的？（仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-27": "他拿走了什么？（仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-28": "选择「是谁干的？」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-29": "蜘蛛的口器抽动。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-3": "一只巨大的蜘蛛守着它们。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-30": "你是在帮我们吗？（依剧情进度、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-31": "「两腿……旧味……冷味……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-32": "「轻轻来……甜言蜜语……然后割……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-33": "「痛痛痛痛痛……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-34": "选择「他拿走了什么？」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-35": "「刺……深刺……古老之毒。」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-36": "「为了血肉……不，为了小小的将死之肉……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-37": "「他拿走……他封印……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-38": "选择「你是在帮我们吗？」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-39": "「不要……碰古神的毒……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-4": "她无数只眼睛大多看着卵。其余的始终不离你。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-40": "「毒能打开……爪子打不开的东西……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-41": "「它若死去……高塔会尖叫……」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-42": "蜘蛛又发出一声痛苦嘶鸣。「说话」显然让她精疲力竭。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-43": "她似乎已经说完了能说的。你不太可能再从她那里得知什么。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-44": "蜘蛛看着你离开。她的口器在黑暗中咬合。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-45": "选择「攻击蜘蛛。」",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-46": "蜘蛛抬起庞大的身体。它的口器以可怕的力量咬合。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-5": "试着和蜘蛛说话。（仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-6": "攻击蜘蛛。（仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-7": "通过灵魂延伸感知。（队伍有麋鹿、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-8": "仔细检查蜘蛛。（队伍有游侠、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.dialogue-9": "蜘蛛守在卵旁，既看着它们，也看着你。",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.l03.detail": "头骨、发霉的面包",
  "maps.points.swamp_spider_nest.l03.detail.item-links": "[[0,2,\"item_bones05\"],[3,8,\"item_food_bread_mold\"]]",
